    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵambopesi akuwulajidwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelepo Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵatisile ku msinda wa Gati nipo ŵajawile kuja kuŵa kumbanga syakuŵandicila ku msinda wa Adulamu. Acalongo acimjakwe pamo ni wosope ŵa mwiŵasa lya babagwe piŵapikene kuti jwalakwe ŵaliji kweleko, ŵajawile kuŵaliji Daudiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mas 57 (Mtwe); Mas 142 (Mtwe)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mundu jwalijose juŵaliji pa yisawusyo, kapena juŵakwete ngongole, kapena juŵaliji jwangasangalala, wosopewo ŵasongene kwa Daudi. Wosope ŵene pamo ŵaliji ŵandu 400 nipo jwalakwe ŵalongolelaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panyuma pakwe Daudi ŵatyosile kweleko kwawula ku Misipa ku Mowabu. Kwele ŵamŵendile mwenye jwa ku Mowabujo kuti, “Conde ŵakunde baba ni mama ŵangu kuti ayice atameje ni jemanja mpaka ndili nayiweni yitacindendela Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Daudi ŵalesile acinangolo ŵakwe ŵala kwa mwenye jwa ku Mowabu nipo ŵatemi kweleko mu ndaŵi josope jiŵajuŵaga mu mbanga mula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwine lina lyakwe Gadi ŵayice kwa Daudi ni ŵamsalile kuti, “Mkatama akuno. Sambano jino jawulani ku cilambo ca Yuda.” Myoyo Daudi ŵatyosile ni kwawula kukwinjila mcipululu ca Heleti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line Saulo ŵaliji ku Gibeya, nipo ŵatemi pasi pa citela ca ukwesu cicamesile petumbi, ali ajigele lipanga m'myala mwakwe, nipo ŵa ngondo ŵakwe ali amsyungulile. Jwalakwe ŵamsalile kuti, Daudi ni ŵa ngondo ŵakwe ŵaweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ŵawusisye ŵa ngondo ŵakwe kuti, “Mpikane jemanja ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini, ana mkuganisya kuti Daudi tacimpa jemanja migunda wamba kapena migunda jana yitela ya mipeleya kwa jwalijose jwa jemanja, nipo soni kuti tacimsandusya jemanja wosope kuŵa ŵakulongolela ŵa makuga ga ngondo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwinetu ni ligongo lyakwe jemanja akundenda une ciswamba! Pangali jumo mwa jemanja juŵasalile kuti mwanangu jwene atesile mkamulano ni Daudi. Pangali jwakusamala ya une kapena kusalila kuti Daudi, jwali jumo mwa ŵandu ŵangu, akusosa apate lipesa lyakuti ambulaje une, nipo kuti mwanangu ni jwakulimbisya mtima kuti anjimucile mpela mwakutendela lelo jinomu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doegi jwa ku Edomu juŵajimi papopo ni asilikali ŵa Saulo, ŵatite kuti, “Une nam'weni Daudi ali mkwawula kwa Ahimeleki mwanace jwa Ahitubi ku Nobu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.7+1SA.21.8+1SA.21.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 21:7-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Mas 52 (Mtwe)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimeleki ŵawusisye AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yakusosekwa kuti Daudi ayitende, nipo kaneko ŵampele Daudi yakulya ni upanga wa Goliyati m'Filisiti jula.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Mwenye Saulo ŵamŵilasisye jwambopesi Ahimeleki ni ŵa pa ulongo ŵakwe wosope ŵiŵaliji nombe nawo ŵambopesi ku Nobu, nipo ŵayice kwa mwenyeko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ŵatite, “Mpikane m'mwe Ahimeleki!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimeleki ŵajanjile kuti, “Elo Ambuje.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ŵamwusisye kuti, “Ligongo cici m'mwejo ni Daudi mwanace jwa Yese mundesile une ciswamba? Ligongo cici mwapelece yakulya ni upanga kwa ŵelewo, mpakana mwawucisye kwa Mlungu? Sambanotu anjimucile une nipo akwamba kwembeceya lipesa lyakumbulajila!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimeleki ŵajanjile kuti, “Daudi ni msilikali jwakulupicika jwakwete wawo mwenye pasikati pa ŵa ngondo ŵawo! Jwejula ali mkwegwe jwawo, jwakulongolela jwa likuga lyawo lyakwacinjilicisya, nipo jwalijose jwa mwiŵasa mwawo akusamcimbicisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakuwona mbusisye m'malo mwa jwalakwejo kwa Mlungu, nambo ana ndandilile lelo kumwucisyako yakuti atende? Iyayi mwenye! Yakuti une ngwajimucila wawojo, ngaŵa myoyo, akusanjimba une magambo kapena jwalijose jwa mwiŵasa mwangu. Une ngingumanyilila cilicose ca jele nganiji amta panandi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambope mwenyejo ŵatite kuti, “M'mwejo Ahimeleki pamo ni acalongo acimjenu wosope mkusosekwa kuwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko ŵasalile alonda ŵiŵaliji nawo kuti, “Mwawulajeni ŵambopesi ŵa AMBUJE! Jemanjaji ŵakamulene ni Daudi nipo nginasalila une kuti jwalakwe ŵatisile, atamose ŵaliji ali ayimanyilile.” Nambo alondawo ŵakanile kunyakula ligasa kuti ŵawulaje ŵambopesi ŵa AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Papopo mwenye ŵamtumile Doegi kuti, “Mwawulaje jemanjaji!” Doegi ŵajawile kuja kwawulaga ŵambopesi wosope ŵala. Ŵawuleje ŵambopesi 85 ŵiŵawete efodi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwa litonji lyakusalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ŵalamwile soni kuti ŵandu ŵane wosope ŵakutama ku Nobu msinda wa ŵambopesi, awulajidwe: acalume, ni acakongwe ŵakwe, ŵanace ni makandi gakwe, ng'ombe, acibulu, ni ngondolo, ŵandu wosopewo ni yinyama yakweyo yiwulajidwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Abiyatala, jumo jwa ŵanace ŵa acalume ŵa Ahimeleki mwanace jwa Ahitubi, ŵatisile, ni kwawula kuŵaliji Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵamsalile Daudi muŵawulajile Saulo ŵambopesi ŵa AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵamsalile Abiyatala kuti, “Pinagambile kumwona Doegi lyele lisiku lila kwekula, namanyilile kuti mwangakayicila kose takamsalile Saulo. Ni ligongo lyakwe magambo ga ciwa ca wosope ŵa liŵasa lya baba ŵenu lili pa une. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo m'mwejo tamani ni une, mkasimjogopa, pakuŵa Saulo akusosa kutuwulaga m'mwejo ni une jwakwe, nambo pitimŵe ni une, timkulupuce.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
